            "review_text": "Vi D\n19 contributions\n0\nA great treat\nSep 2018 • Couples\nA great feed, I ordered the pepperoni pizza, fries and garlic bread and it was great. Although English was not their strong point they tried hard to really understand the order and get it to perfection. She even neatly wrapped up the food in a takeaway plastic bag so no food can drop out or move too much.\n\nFantastic service from a little Small fast food shop.\n\n5/5\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2018",
